  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - Hercules Constellation
  - "A-\nThis is so weird, writing to you at World\u2019s End. We were supposed to
    be together by now. Fate really sucks sometimes, huh? \n\nI\u2019ve been staring
    at the Hercules constellation a lot, so I drew it for you. He had 12 labors\u2026
    jobs to do. Lately I feel sort of like him. I\u2019m traveling to all 12 CERES
    stations in the Midwest, getting them ready for what\u2019s coming. This is big,
    Astrid. We\u2019re running out of time. But if it works, it\u2019ll change everything.
    \n\nI mean\u2026 as long as you keep working on the Project Herules puzzles.
    (No pressure, right?) I'm sorry. I wish I was with you. \n-E"
